@page "/security"
<PageTitle>Security & Privacy - BlackHatBadshah</PageTitle>

<div id="security-page">
    <div id="security-header">
        <h1>Security & Privacy</h1>
        <p id="security-subtitle">Your data security and privacy are our top priorities</p>
    </div>

    <div id="security-content">

        <!-- Data Security Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">🛡️</div>
            <h2>Data Security</h2>
            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>End-to-End Encryption</h3>
                <p>
                    All data transmitted between your browser and our servers is encrypted using
                    industry-standard TLS 1.3 protocol. Your log files and analysis reports are
                    encrypted at rest using AES-256 encryption on our secure distributed storage systems.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Secure Authentication</h3>
                <p>
                    We use Keycloak-based OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect for authentication.
                    Your credentials are never stored on our servers. All API requests are
                    authenticated using JWT tokens with automatic expiration.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Infrastructure Security</h3>
                <p>
                    Our backend infrastructure is hosted on secure, geographically distributed servers worldwide with enterprise-grade security features:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) protection</li>
                    <li>Regular security patches and updates</li>
                    <li>Network isolation and firewall rules</li>
                    <li>Continuous monitoring and threat detection</li>
                    <li>Geographic redundancy across multiple data centers</li>
                    <li>Private network infrastructure with no public cloud dependencies</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Privacy Policy Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">🔒</div>
            <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Data Collection</h3>
                <p>
                    We collect only the data necessary to provide our services:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Authentication Data:</strong> Email address and user ID from your identity provider</li>
                    <li><strong>Log Files:</strong> Files you upload for analysis</li>
                    <li><strong>Analysis Reports:</strong> AI-generated reports based on your logs</li>
                    <li><strong>Usage Metadata:</strong> Timestamps and file metadata for service operation</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="privacy-note">
                    We do NOT collect browsing history, personal information beyond authentication,
                    or any data from your systems other than what you explicitly upload.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Data Usage</h3>
                <p>
                    Your data is used exclusively for:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Performing log analysis and generating reports</li>
                    <li>Providing customer support when requested</li>
                    <li>Improving our AI models (only with anonymized, aggregated data)</li>
                    <li>Complying with legal obligations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="privacy-highlight">
                    We NEVER sell your data to third parties or use it for advertising.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Data Sharing</h3>
                <p>
                    Your log files and reports are isolated to your account. We share data only when:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>You explicitly grant access to specific users</li>
                    <li>Required by law or legal process</li>
                    <li>Necessary to protect our rights or prevent fraud</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    We use leading AI providers (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI, and open-source models) for log analysis.
                    Data sent to these services is processed according to their respective enterprise privacy policies
                    and is not used to train public models. All AI processing uses enterprise-grade API agreements
                    with strict data protection guarantees.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Retention Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">📅</div>
            <h2>Data Retention</h2>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Storage Duration</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>Log Files:</strong> Stored for 90 days from upload, then automatically deleted<br />
                    <strong>Analysis Reports:</strong> Stored for 1 year from creation, then automatically deleted<br />
                    <strong>Account Data:</strong> Retained while your account is active
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Data Deletion</h3>
                <p>
                    You can delete your logs and reports at any time from the respective pages.
                    To request complete account deletion, contact support. Upon account deletion:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>All your log files are permanently deleted within 24 hours</li>
                    <li>All your reports are permanently deleted within 24 hours</li>
                    <li>Authentication records are retained for 30 days for security purposes</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Your Rights Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h2>Your Rights</h2>

            <div class="security-card">
                <p>
                    You have the right to:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Access:</strong> View all data associated with your account</li>
                    <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> Correct any inaccurate data</li>
                    <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> Delete your data at any time</li>
                    <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Export your data in machine-readable format</li>
                    <li><strong>Object:</strong> Opt-out of automated processing</li>
                    <li><strong>Complaint:</strong> Lodge complaints with data protection authorities</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Security Best Practices Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">✅</div>
            <h2>Security Best Practices</h2>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Recommendations for Users</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Use strong, unique passwords for your authentication provider</li>
                    <li>Enable multi-factor authentication (MFA) if available</li>
                    <li>Review and sanitize log files before uploading to remove sensitive data</li>
                    <li>Log out from shared or public computers</li>
                    <li>Regularly review your uploaded files and delete what you no longer need</li>
                    <li>Report any suspicious activity immediately</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="security-card">
                <h3>Incident Response</h3>
                <p>
                    In the event of a security incident, we will:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Investigate and contain the incident within 24 hours</li>
                    <li>Notify affected users within 72 hours</li>
                    <li>Provide detailed information about the incident and remediation steps</li>
                    <li>Report to relevant authorities as required by law</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Section -->
        <section class="security-section">
            <div class="section-icon">📧</div>
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>

            <div class="security-card">
                <p>
                    For security concerns, privacy questions, or data requests, contact us at:
                </p>
                <p class="contact-info">
                    <strong>Security:</strong> security@blackhatbadshah.com<br />
                    <strong>Privacy:</strong> privacy@blackhatbadshah.com<br />
                    <strong>Data Requests:</strong> data@blackhatbadshah.com
                </p>
                <p class="security-note">
                    <em>Last updated: December 2025</em>
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .section-icon {
        font-size: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
    }
</style>

